Language (UML) 2.5.1 specification and its machine-readable XMI files directly from
https://www.omg.org/spec/UML/. Neither the specification PDF nor the XMI files are redistributed,
committed, or bundled with this repository or any release of it - see sources/README.md for the
exact files and URLs, and CLAUDE.md ("Committed vs git-ignored") for how this is enforced.

